+
+# Implement createPatch (RFC 6902 diff)
+
+Added `createPatch(from, to)` in `src/diff.ts`, exported from `src/index.ts`. It returns a JSON Patch
+listing only the differences, so a small change gives a small patch. Moved `jsonEqual` from
+`src/patch.ts` to `src/json.ts` to share it. Tests in `test/diff.test.ts` check that `applyPatch`
+turns `from` into `to`, that patches are minimal, escaping, `__proto__`, immutability and non-JSON
+input; `npm test` passes (67 tests).
+
